#set page(width:auto, height: auto, margin:0.5em)

- I want to quickly jot down quantities of different units
- I want to calculate easily with these variables
- I don't want to worry about units
- I want to trust that the results I'm getting are true
- I want to provide error values
- I want to be able to define a formula which I can then reuse across my document
- I want to display how I reached a value
  - I want to be able to show the full calculation
  - I want to be able to show just the most recent step
    - i.e. application of a formula
    - that step may be multiple calculations, I don't want those to be treated differently
  - I want to be able to show the formula using alternative symbols (U instead of V or I instead of ohm)
  - I want to be able to show the formula using just the units
- I want to be able to automatically calculate the error depending on the variances I define at the beginning
- I want to be able to display the error individually and as part of the full value, or hide it
- I want to show the way the error was calculated
  
